Specific commands:
- Press Right Shift for use Volley on target;
- Press Right Alt for change Aimeid Shot / Multi-Shot;
- Focus Tank for use Misdirection;

MM Hunter PvP / Battlegrounds.

STRATEGY: assist-train squishies. Set /focus on the enemy healer before engaging.

MANUAL:
- Right Shift toggles Volley (leave OFF in BG);
- Right Alt swaps Aimed / Multi (Aimed = default);
- Left Ctrl pauses rotation;
- Manually place Frost/Freezing Trap under yourself when melee sticks.

DEFENSIVE AUTO:
- Deterrence: HP &lt; 40%, or &lt; 70% with a melee player in range;
- Disengage: HP &lt; 75% with melee in range;
- Master&apos;s Call: any common snare on you;
- Feign Death: HP &lt; 25% AND Deterrence + Disengage on CD.

CC ENGINE (needs /focus):
- Silencing Shot fires on focus interruptible casts;
- Scatter Shot on healing/casting focus;
- Wyvern Sting fallback when Silencing on CD.

BURST: Rapid Fire + Readiness + Call of the Wild fire auto on players HP &gt; 30-40%.

AIMED SHOT is only cast when Improved Steady Shot proc is up (safe window).
